# Mobirise AI Website Builder

> Free AI website generator. Describe your idea in a prompt and Mobirise AI creates four website designs with text and images. No sign-up is needed to try it; edit the result in chat or in a visual editor and publish it on a free subdomain, your own domain or any hosting.

## Main pages

- [Mobirise AI Website Builder](https://mobiri.se/): prompt form, how the generator works, prompt tips and examples, FAQ
- [Pricing](https://mobirise.com/p/): free and paid plans
- [Log in](https://a.mobirise.com/): open and edit your projects

## Help

- [Help Center](https://mobirise.com/help/): guides for building and publishing sites
- [Forum](https://forums.mobirise.com/): questions and answers from the community

## Optional

- [Mobirise desktop app](https://mobirise.co/): the same builder as a free app for Windows, Mac and Linux that also works offline
